id: weather-calling
name: Weather Calling
kind: signature
side: advantages
tpCost: 10
requirement: Elemental Profile that is a Connected Profile to a Battle Weather (see — Battle Weather)
requires: elemental-weather
summary: On a hit, the Connected Battle Weather in a Sphere on them: Natural for a Super, Unnatural for an Ultimate - set by hand.
description: >
  Change the Battle Weather through your magic.
text: >
  Weather Calling: Change the Battle Weather through your magic.
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Requirement: Elemental Profile that is a Connected Profile to a Battle Weather (see — Battle Weather)
  –Effect: When you hit an Opponent with this Signature Technique, apply the Battle Weather in a Sphere AoE (centered on that Opponent) whose Connected Profile is your Elemental Profile for this Signature Technique. The Tier is Natural if this is a Super Signature and Unnatural if this Attacking Maneuver is an Ultimate Signature.

---

# No script: what this does is read where the Technique is built or the attack is rolled
# (module/technique.mjs, module/signature.mjs). See the plan's feature table.
